WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.430
Okay, now for the next letter.

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:08.500
Let's see, it's from pen name Yoshi.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:09.860
All right!

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.200
It's me.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:21.450
It's getting dark, and all the other teachers have gone home.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.420
I'm sorry.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.800
I was trying to get ready for the new semester.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:34.540
The new semester? I see.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:40.390
I really appreciate your working this hard for the students.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:41.640
It's nothing.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:49.270
But if you're trying to help the students, we can't have you showing up late tomorrow.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:50.400
Of course!

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:58.030
The campus is quiet right now, but soon, it'll be bustling again.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:00:59.230
Yes.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.540
Today, she becomes a second year!

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.230
Morning, Yunocchi!

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:38.440
Good morning, Miya.

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:40.640
It's such a peaceful morning.

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:44.160
How are you? It feels great, doesn't it?

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:49.030
We get out early today, right?

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:52.210
Yeah. What should we do for lunch?

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:52.920
Already!?

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:01.980
Good morning, Sae.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.470
Good morning.

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:07.470
Sorry, did we wake you up?

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:11.350
Don't worry about it. What are you up to?

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:13.060
I'm exercising.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:16.820
The new semester starts today, so I wanted to try something new.

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.930
I see.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.200
Sae? Morning!

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:23.870
Good morning, Miyako.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.840
Oh, Nori!

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.200
Good morning!

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:30.000
Good morning!

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.330
What are you doing?

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.580
Exercising!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:38.960
Nazuna!

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:46.760
Yunocchi?

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:50.520
Nazuna was watching just now.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:58.400
You're all up so early. I'm going back to bed for a bit.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.150
We're all up an hour earlier than usual.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:04.240
You're going back to bed? You just got up.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:07.240
Remember, early to rise makes a man wealthy!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:10.750
But it feels so nice to go back to bed.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:15.460
We live right by school, so we can sleep in.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.250
That's the great thing about Hidamari Apartments.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.090
Sae...

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:26.100
April 8th~9th

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:26.100
"Decision"

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.640
We will now begin the opening ceremony.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:35.150
First, a few words from the principal.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.150
Good morning, everyone.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:45.390
It's said that New Year's morning sets the tone for the whole year.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:49.660
Such days are very important.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:53.840
Take a deep breath and gaze forward.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:58.670
Let us richly experience every day of the next year.

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:05.470
On the other hand, unexcused absence on important days is extremely unfortunate.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:10.680
Starting the year in such a manner makes me feel extremely uneasy.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:16.940
It seems she never was prepared to be a teacher!

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:20.440
Next, we—

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:21.860
Hello!

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:28.280
Pleased to meet you, first years!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:32.870
I'm Yoshinoya, the homeroom teacher for the art department's class 2-A!

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:36.140
Next is a word from the vice principal.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:38.540
Teacher introductions come after that.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:52.120
Man, not even the teachers have changed.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.430
Yeah.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:58.690
Yuno, Miyako, what's up?

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.440
Nori?

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.940
Art Dept.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:07.950
We were, um, just looking for you.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.070
Huh? Why?

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:12.700
How are you feeling?

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:13.630
Fine.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.330
Art Dept.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.330
Good morning!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:22.380
I can't wait to teach you this year too!

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:29.640
Looking
forward
to this
year

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:28.150
These are your new seating assignments.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:35.430
Looking
forward
to this
year

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:35.430
How did you come up with these?

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:39.440
Fill in the boys' seats and you'll see.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.000
I'm glad we're still close together.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:53.700
Yeah.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:57.960
It's a good thing we're not the other way around.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:04.120
Hey, Yuno and Miyako.

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:04.960
Good morning.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.840
Wow, it's been a while.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:10.210
I didn't realize the art department kept the same classes.

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:14.850
Yeah, once we're in together, we stay in the same class.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.850
Art Dept.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.980
It goes vice versa too.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.230
Natsume?

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.730
Art Dept.

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:25.230
As second years, you'll be able to select planes,

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:31.610
solids, or information to study as an elective.

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:36.040
When you decide, just get in touch, 'kay?

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.790
Which one should I do?

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:44.780
What do I do?

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.750
I'm horrible at making decisions.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.880
Why? Deciding is fun!

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:55.050
I've already decided on potatoes tonight.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.310
For dinner!?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.390
Welcome back!

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:02.750
Welcome back!

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.230
We're home!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.650
You first years got done first?

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.990
Yeah, orientation is tomorrow.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.610
The opening ceremony was surprising.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:20.000
Miss Yoshinoya's the teacher you were
talking about at our welcoming party, isn't she?

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:23.120
She's just as intense as you said.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:27.380
Yeah, but she really cares about her students.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:31.880
Hey!

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.010
Hello!

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:39.350
Nori, Nazuna, this is Hidamari Apartments' landlady.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:42.730
Oh, yeah. I've already said hello.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:44.230
Me too.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.980
I... I see.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.620
I just came to check up on things.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.360
You started school again today, right?

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.450
Yeah.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.240
Are you settling in okay?

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:58.990
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:03.250
That's good. You aren't afraid of the older girls?

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.250
Of course not.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:09.450
They held a welcoming party the day before last.

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:14.760
We got one too.

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.760
It's kind of a Hidamari Apartments tradition.

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:26.900
Hey, do you have any candy or gum or anything?

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.690
I have some.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:35.990
Thanks.

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:40.660
It's too sweet.

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.050
Oh well, better than nothing.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:45.330
O, Nazuna! Rain down your blessings upon us!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.160
Sure.

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:50.750
I'm relieved you first years are doing well.

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.670
Anyway, see you later.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:55.170
Goodbye!

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:57.840
Let's go back to our rooms.

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:01.720
Oh, are you two in any clubs?

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:05.230
No, neither of us are.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.490
Sae and Hiro aren't either.

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:09.980
It's not really something people in the art department do.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.110
Nori, are you going to join a club?

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:15.110
I haven't decided yet.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:16.630
How about you, Nazuna?

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:19.110
I haven't yet either.

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:25.410
They said we should check out a few, though.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.140
Yeah.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.500
I see.

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:32.000
Those two seem like they're having fun.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.510
We were really excited around this time last year too.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.070
See you, Yunocchi.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:38.510
Later.

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:43.850
Electives, huh?

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.810
Sorry to bother you while you're working.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:48.600
It's fine.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:50.470
Are you having a hard time deciding?

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:54.630
You're just choosing extra lessons.

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:58.630
It's not like you can't study whatever you don't choose.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.610
I guess you're right.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:08.710
Sae did planes, right?

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.790
Yeah, she did.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.630
She made up her mind right away.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:18.130
I did planes.

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:26.640
Hiro, did you do planes too?

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:32.160
I'm not really good with solids or computers.

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:39.490
So, I thought it would be best to get better at what I am good at.

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:40.900
So, I picked planes.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.660
Don't worry, you're still just a second year.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:51.460
What do you want to do right now?

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:53.960
Sorry to bother you!

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:01.340
Miya's probably already decided.

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:07.470
No, no! I have to pick by myself!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:17.230
No, no! I have to pick by myself!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:21.610
All right, I'll rearrange to cheer up!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.870
It'll be a fresh start to a fresh school year!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:33.370
What's Yuno doing up there?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.130
My bed's too heavy.

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:46.620
Oh, how nostalgic!

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:51.390
So that's where it was. I was wondering where it went.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:56.270
Mom sent this right after I moved in.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.120
It's so nostalgic.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:02.490
It's so nostalgic.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:12.700
When I first came here, I used to get lonely at night sometimes.

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:15.000
I always read it before going to bed.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:22.510
Have fun and do
MMyour best every day

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:22.510
This tiny little postcard, with just a picture and a few words, made me so happy.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.260
Hey Yunocchi, let's hang out!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.270
Wow, your room's completely different!

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:42.030
Miya, I decided on planes!

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:44.400
I picked solids.

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:46.280
Why solids?

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:49.910
They all sounded fun, so I just drew straws.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:50.780
Wow.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.530
Yunocchi?

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:16.810
One step forward, two steps back...

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.060
April 8th~9th
The end

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.060
To be continued

